ay","g":"sights","k":"landmark","la":17.749167,"lo":-64.892222,"d":4114,"ds":"Estate Butler's Bay, on the island of Saint Croix in the U.S. Virgin Islands, was established as a sugar plantation by 1764. It was listed on the National Register of Historic Places in 1978. The listing included five contributing buildings, a contributing structure, and five contributing sites.","wpu":"Estate Butler's Bay","img":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/22/Frederik_von_Scholten_-_Butlers_Bay%2C_St._Croix.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled"},{"n":"St. George Village Botanical Garden","g":"sights","k":"landmark","la":17.7152,"lo":-64.8307,"d":5650,"ds":"The St. George Village Botanical Garden (16 acres) is a botanical garden with arboretum located at 127 Estate St. George, Frederiksted, Saint Croix, U.S. Virgin Islands.","wpu":"St. George Village Botanical Garden","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/2008-07-17_St._George_Village_Botanical_Gardens_St._Croix_USVI.jpg/960px-2008-07-17_St._George_Village_Botanical_Gardens_St._Croix_USVI.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},{"n":"Hams Bay, U.S. Virgin Islands","g":"sights","k":"landmark","la":17.765556,"lo":-64.880833,"d":5853,"ds":"Hams Bay is a settlement on the island of Saint Croix in the United States Virgin Islands.","wpu":"Hams Bay, U.S. Virgin Islands","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Ham%27s_Bay_paa_St.Croix._November_1833.jpg/960px-Ham%27s_Bay_paa_St.Croix._November_1833.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"}],"about":{"ds":"Frederiksted (Danish for \"Frederik's Place\") is both a town and one of the two administrative districts of St. Croix, U.S. Virgin Islands. It is a grid-planned city, designed by surveyor Jens Beckfor, originally to 14×14 blocks but built 7×7 to enhance the island commerce in the 1700s.","wpu":"Frederiksted, U.S. Virgin Islands","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/Saint_Croix_2012_Wade_2.JPG/960px-Saint_Croix_2012_Wade_2.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},"wk":"2026-10-18"}